# Loom Witness Mesh

Concept-ID: `SOUNIO-LOOM-WITNESS-MESH`

Status: executable bounded external monotonic authority. Promotion evidence is
retained in `tools/loom/evidence/loom-witness-mesh-v0-20260826.txt` and
`tools/loom/evidence/loom-witness-mesh-v1-20260826.txt`.

